56:11.240 --> 56:14.283
a living human being here in the city that lives

56:14.315 --> 56:18.512
here across the street and works at the local high school. And anybody

56:19.012 --> 56:22.677
that comes in, we're trying to vet as best as possible. We've hired

56:22.887 --> 56:25.377
