01:13:03.882 --> 01:13:06.387
Like, if I ever sell my house, I'm not selling it to a rental company,

01:13:06.403 --> 01:13:09.965
not 'cause I can't, but 'cause I want to leave my neighborhood

01:13:10.465 --> 01:13:13.075
a certain way. And that's just kind of how I feel. We can't control who

01:13:13.575 --> 01:13:16.822
