01:13:17.322 --> 01:13:20.633
those who you feel would be the best fit for our community and our city,

01:13:20.812 --> 01:13:24.172
which I think those we bought in so far have done— have been

01:13:24.380 --> 01:13:29.324
good partners and, um, American-loving partners,

01:13:29.516 --> 01:13:32.100
if you want to go that way. Right. At least kind of reading between the

01:13:32.600 --> 01:13:35.776
lines. But, um, anyways, that's, that's just a kind of a side note. But,

01:13:35.856 --> 01:13:39.082
uh, as far as the RTTI zone goes, you know, that's not going to

01:13:40.045 --> 01:13:44.491
affect who buys it or who doesn't purchase it or ends up eventually,

01:13:45.229 --> 01:13:48.783
um, developing the property. But, uh, to Definitely we

01:13:49.283 --> 01:13:51.926
want to encourage good partners here in the community. I know you guys are the

01:13:52.426 --> 01:13:55.489
same way, so I don't think that's going to be a concern in my mind.

01:13:55.635 --> 01:13:58.224
Okay.

