01:18:58.635 --> 01:19:01.527
clauses in this agreement you will see in every one we have, whether whether it's

01:19:02.027 --> 01:19:05.561
with Meta or with QTS and, you know, Tract or whatever,

01:19:06.771 --> 01:19:10.451
