01:19:10.951 --> 01:19:13.340
specific to this agreement are in Article 5 regarding the infrastructure.

01:19:17.468 --> 01:19:22.060
I guess one question I had, it looks like developer can withdraw

01:19:22.367 --> 01:19:24.929
maybe for any reason or at any time for any reason? Yeah.

01:19:27.250 --> 01:19:30.780
So they're not obligated to develop. Right, to build

01:19:31.280 --> 01:19:32.247
a— If they do develop,

01:19:35.328 --> 01:19:39.127
then they're bound by this agreement. So we can clarify

01:19:39.627 --> 01:19:43.780
that. If you're talking about Article VII, we can clarify that language

01:19:43.893 --> 01:19:47.688
that, you know, prior to development they can terminate

01:19:48.188 --> 01:19:51.937
it, not subsequent to starting development. So I'll

01:19:52.437 --> 01:19:55.596
