01:19:55.789 --> 01:19:59.270
And then I wasn't sure, I guess, on the 20-year timeframe.

01:19:59.976 --> 01:20:03.377
Yeah, um, feels like a long time to kind of handcuff the city.

01:20:03.601 --> 01:20:07.178
So most of our agreements with data centers involve larger

01:20:07.678 --> 01:20:11.349
