01:21:29.727 --> 01:21:33.092
again, like things like the wastewater, you know, sewer pipes,

01:21:33.572 --> 01:21:37.002
water lines, things like that, that before you go vertical.

01:21:37.883 --> 01:21:41.357
And so this one, Where we're at,

01:21:43.686 --> 01:21:46.304
I think it's— You know, where things are— I mean, well, obviously there are certain—

01:21:46.804 --> 01:21:48.389
it's not like they don't know at all what they're going to do with the

01:21:48.889 --> 01:21:52.769
property, but things are still in flux. It's a little bit trickier to

01:21:52.834 --> 01:21:56.542
put those types of milestones in place. And we can add milestones to the agreement

01:21:57.042 --> 01:22:01.054
and kind of discuss with the other party what those might look like.

01:22:02.504 --> 01:22:05.904
But yeah. It's a little bit

01:22:06.404 --> 01:22:09.308
trickier under the current circumstances. Yeah, understood.

01:22:09.516 --> 01:22:12.487
