but are those reviewed, future phases,

01:23:39.631 --> 01:23:43.003
by staff as far as, hey, the next item

01:23:43.503 --> 01:23:46.584
we're gonna do, we're looking to— Right, so every time a land use application comes

01:23:46.680 --> 01:23:50.389
before the city, that's being reviewed by staff.

01:23:51.128 --> 01:23:54.801
So if somebody's doing a site plan application, a plat application, those things

01:23:55.301 --> 01:23:58.569
